# Minimal, deterministic PLUMED input for the LAMMPS "fix plumed" unit test.
# Kept cheap on purpose: no history-dependent bias (so a restarted run
# reproduces the reference trajectory exactly) and no output files.
#
# PLUMED works in its own internal units (nm, kJ/mol, ps); fix plumed
# installs the conversion from the "real" units of the in.fourmol system.

d1: DISTANCE ATOMS=1,2
d2: DISTANCE ATOMS=3,4
a1: ANGLE    ATOMS=1,2,3
cn: COORDINATION GROUPA=1-10 GROUPB=11-29 R_0=0.3

# Restrain all four, so that every atom in the system receives a bias force
# and the global bias energy and virial are both nonzero.
RESTRAINT ARG=d1,d2,a1,cn KAPPA=500.0,500.0,100.0,10.0 AT=0.15,0.15,1.9,5.0
